fense of the York cause, while the appearance of a boy in Burgundy claiming to be a young prince threatens to further destabilize King Henry's rule.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AbOK1zj2beMYbrm72ZpyXmn9UVu.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLVdoaXRlLVByaW5jZXNzLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktU2VyaWVzLTIwMTctJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.6","title":"English Blood on English Soil","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2017-05-21T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"King Henry VII and Lizzie travel to Spain in an attempt to secure their son's betrothal. Meanwhile, unrest has been growing in Burgundy and spills over into an English battle.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5NS1tagF44DnfeXkNg9aV9snNMP.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLVdoaXRlLVByaW5jZXNzLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktU2VyaWVzLTIwMTctJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.7","title":"Two Kings","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2017-05-28T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A pretender to the throne is held captive at court, confounding the Tudors, and creating a new rift in Lizzie and King Henry's marriage. Lizzie faces an impossible choice, and makes a risky move to try to eliminate the threat to her family.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ly5pSTbIm5qJurFNDxki1c8iHzU.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLVdoaXRlLVByaW5jZXNzLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktU2VyaWVzLTIwMTctJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.8","title":"Old Curses","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2017-06-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A final confrontation with the pretender exposes King Henry's weaknesses, while Lizzie confronts new demons and old curses.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kCQF8Yhtj4vtuxgppEGmYk0nD8K.jpg"}]}}